msgctxt "#32040"
msgid "Auto detects the TV resolution and caps the quality accordingly (up to 4K on a 4K panel, up to 1080p on Full HD). Pick a fixed value to limit quality on weaker devices."
msgstr "Auto detecteaza rezolutia televizorului si limiteaza calitatea in consecinta (pana la 4K pe un ecran 4K, pana la 1080p pe Full HD). Alege o valoare fixa pentru a limita calitatea pe dispozitive mai slabe."

msgctxt "#32041"
msgid "Off = no subtitles. Original = the subtitle track YouTube marks as default. Preferred language = the Content language track, auto-translated by YouTube when the uploader has no such track."
msgstr "Oprit = fara subtitrare. Original = pista de subtitrare pe care YouTube o marcheaza ca implicita. Limba preferata = pista in limba continutului, tradusa automat de YouTube cand uploaderul nu are o astfel de pista."

msgctxt "#32042"
msgid "Leave empty to use the Content language. Example: ro for Romanian subtitles on an English video."
msgstr "Lasa gol pentru a folosi limba continutului. Exemplu: pt pentru subtitrare in portugheza la un clip in engleza."

msgctxt "#32043"
msgid "Country used for search, Trending, Live and Trailers results."
msgstr "Tara folosita pentru cautare, trenduri, live si trailere."

msgctxt "#32044"
msgid "Two-letter country code not listed above, for example PL, KR, VN."
msgstr "Cod de tara de doua litere care nu apare mai sus, de exemplu PL, KR, VN."

msgctxt "#32045"
msgid "Language of the returned metadata and of the Trending/Live/Trailers category searches."
msgstr "Limba metadatelor returnate si a cautarilor de categorii din trenduri, live si trailere."

msgctxt "#32046"
msgid "Language code not listed above, for example he, fa, uk, zh-TW, fil. Category searches fall back to English words for languages without a translation table."
msgstr "Cod de limba care nu apare mai sus, de exemplu he, fa, uk, zh-TW, fil. Cautarile de categorii folosesc cuvinte in engleza pentru limbile fara tabel de traduceri."

msgctxt "#32047"
msgid "Category listed when Trending is opened without a choice."
msgstr "Categoria afisata cand Trenduri se deschide fara alegere."

msgctxt "#32048"
msgid "Category listed when Live is opened without a choice."
msgstr "Categoria afisata cand Live se deschide fara alegere."

msgctxt "#32049"
msgid "Original plays the original audio track only. Localized prefers an audio track in your Content language and falls back to the original when none exists."
msgstr "Original reda doar pista audio originala. Localizat prefera o pista audio in limba continutului si revine la original cand nu exista."

msgctxt "#32050"
msgid "On: after a video ends the next one from the same list keeps playing, in the exact order you see (Trending, Random music, Live, Search results, a channel). A video started from outside this add-on (TMDb Movies) gets a random music track instead. Off: nothing plays on its own."
msgstr " Pornit: cand se termina un clip, continua cu urmatorul din aceeasi lista, exact in ordinea afisata (trenduri, muzica aleatoare, live, rezultatele cautarii, un canal). Un clip pornit din alt addon (TMDb Movies) primeste in schimb o piesa aleatoare. Oprit: nimic nu se reda singur."

msgctxt "#32051"
msgid "On: the clicked video still plays first, but what follows is shuffled instead of the list order. Same pool as Autoplay, just random."
msgstr "Pornit: clipul pe care l-ai apasat se reda tot primul, dar ce urmeaza este amestecat in loc de a respecta ordinea listei. Aceeasi sursa ca la Redare automata, doar aleator."

msgctxt "#32052"
msgid "How many videos a list page shows. Larger pages build longer playlists."
msgstr "Cate clipuri arata o pagina de lista. Pagini mai mari construiesc liste de redare mai lungi."

msgctxt "#32053"
msgid "How many videos each subscribed channel contributes to the feed."
msgstr "Cate clipuri contribuie fiecare canal abonat la flux."

msgctxt "#32054"
msgid "Writes detailed extraction and playback lines to kodi.log and bypasses the listing cache."
msgstr "Scrie in kodi.log detalii despre extragere si redare si ocoleste cache-ul listelor."

msgctxt "#32055"
msgid "Deletes the downloaded listings, the music pool and the queue state."
msgstr "Sterge listele descarcate, poolul de muzica si starea cozii."

msgctxt "#32056"
msgid "Link your YouTube account to browse subscriptions, Watch Later, playlists and history."
msgstr "Conecteaza-ti contul YouTube pentru a vedea abonamentele, Vezi mai tarziu, listele si istoricul."

msgctxt "#32057"
msgid "Removes the linked YouTube account and its local snapshot."
msgstr "Elimina contul YouTube conectat si copia locala a lui."

